        // In mutant: balA_pranked = _balances[msg.sender] = _balances[a] (zero) and balB_pranked = _balances[b] (zero) => still equal
        // Need different balances for a and b
        // Let's have a stake some, b not
        // But we need stakingToken transfers - we can use the test contract as staking token
        // Actually stakingToken = address(this) in constructor => the test contract
